        "official_en_sha256": "5a55e9993caf6250c9dfc7a1eaf931978a212173a1dc1136879bb6a630c470f4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "うんざりするほど戦争を繰り返すのは\r\nパラデイアと同じだった。",
        "official_en": "The endless cycle of war was sickening, and no different than in Paladia.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
