        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C08_807_01:807_01_018:f2d435fc",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C08_807_01:807_01_018:f2d435fc",
        "jp_sha256": "220edd6ece10924af15c6c6ebb7ac9d04b40cb04e69a289ef228256f69715d61",
        "official_en_sha256": "fe9f9699b4802158a90ee9f267e11c907d9325473056ec80a812721e34dc7e64"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それだけじゃない。\r\nこの旅で出会った人たちが教えてくれたんだ。",
        "official_en": "And that’s just off the top of my head. I have a whole list of people I met on my travels that can prove my point.",
        "real_en": "And that's not all. The people I've met on this journey taught me that."
      },
