        "official_en_sha256": "3e9059c9fd7f39e22846065c9dae24f19e3eb2923fe8c5678a340b55121592af"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ベヒーモスよ。\r\n惨めに足掻く者たちを始末しろ。",
        "official_en": "Behemoth... Put an end to these wretched creatures.",
        "real_en": "Behemoth, finish off those wretches still struggling."
      },
      "review": {
