        "official_en_sha256": "03d168046e6bb4308748f79d5f83508b0d632f2cec839bcd2abbb7f714152216"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "命に執着する姿は醜悪そのものだな。",
        "official_en": "Seeing how you cling to life is so utterly repulsive.",
