        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C08_807_01:807_01_027:bf9561be",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C08_807_01:807_01_027:bf9561be",
        "jp_sha256": "e0f994f54156bc6e57eee1403a4570b9176837c265f7555a780dbfe2a7ea9a33",
        "official_en_sha256": "650b3d809a5b0442a800e58c3e4ba32480209a942dc264bca9d2296183bd912e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "私たちのことを気にしている場合か。\r\nベヒーモスは力を出し惜しんで\r\nどうにかなる相手じゃないぞ。",
        "official_en": "Don’t concern yourselves with us. We are fighting Behemoth, after all. We must give everything we can.",
        "real_en": "This is no time to worry about us. Behemoth isn't an enemy we can beat while holding back."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
