        "official_en_sha256": "19a10c7f60bfcf243043c9ad934226548670ce223c119c54ae21d2b5a0c256eb"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "私はクリスタルの中から精神を飛ばし、\r\nこの世界の様子を７００年間に渡って観察してきた。",
        "official_en": "For seven hundred years, I projected my consciousness from within the Crystal and observed the state of this world.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
